      "id": "q01",
      "answer": "Spring PetClinic is a runnable Spring Boot sample clinic web application: users browse veterinarians and maintain owners, pets, and visits through a browser. Developers run it with ./mvnw spring-boot:run, ./gradlew bootRun, or an IDE, then visit localhost:8080. Browser HTTP requests enter Spring MVC controllers; this is an application, not merely a library.",
