      "id": "q02",
      "answer": "PetClinicApplication bootstraps the application. The owner package contains Owner/Pet/Visit domain and web workflows plus persistence interfaces; Owner aggregates pets. The vet package serves veterinarian lists through VetController and VetRepository. The model package supplies shared entity/Person properties. The system package includes the welcome route and caching configuration. Thymeleaf templates render the HTML UI; database resources seed persistent domain data, selected by application properties. Repository interfaces are Spring Data boundaries, not hand-written service implementations.",
