      "id": "q03",
      "answer": "Java 17 application/test sources use org.springframework.samples.petclinic with owner, vet, model, and system package boundaries. Maven pom.xml and Groovy build.gradle describe the same spring-petclinic application, using Spring Boot 4.1.0, Spring MVC, Spring Data JPA, Thymeleaf, validation, caching, and database drivers. Resources include HTML/Thymeleaf, JavaScript, SQL, properties and generated CSS from SCSS/Bootstrap. Tests use JUnit Jupiter, Spring test slices, MockMvc and Mockito. These package divisions are not evidence of separately deployed services.",
