      "id": "q05",
      "answer": "The persistence definition is owner.OwnerRepository.findByLastNameStartingWith(String lastName, Pageable pageable), returning Page<Owner>. OwnerRepository extends JpaRepository<Owner,Integer>; its documentation explicitly specifies starts-with matching. There is no method body here: execution is supplied dynamically by Spring Data JPA. OwnerController.findPaginatedForOwnersLastName delegates to this method.",
