      "id": "q07",
      "answer": "MVC selects processFindForm; findOwner supplies a new Owner and binding supplies Franklin. The handler calls findPaginatedForOwnersLastName(1,\"Franklin\") → PageRequest.of(0,5) → repository prefix query. One result redirects to /owners/{id}; following it invokes showOwner/findById and ownerDetails. Zero results return findOwners with an error; multiple return ownersList. Seed data has George Franklin; the MVC fixture explicitly expects /owners/1. Live database contents, framework binding/query generation, redirect following and rendering are runtime boundaries, not executed evidence.",
