      "id": "q09",
      "answer": "ClinicServiceTests.shouldFindOwnersByLastName is a @DataJpaTest with injected OwnerRepository; it directly calls findByLastNameStartingWith using unpaged Davis (two results) and Daviss (empty). shouldInsertOwner also queries that API before/after insertion. OwnerControllerTests is @WebMvcTest(OwnerController.class) with a MockitoBean repository: processFindFormByLastName enters through MockMvc GET /owners?page=1 plus lastName=Franklin and expects a redirect. Whitespace, whitespace-only, no-match, multiple-result and out-of-range-page cases exercise controller behavior; repository mocking means these MVC cases do not validate actual SQL matching. The findOwners template supplies a GET form to /owners. These were inspected, not run.",
